      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i need some help writing a formal letter to our local school board. there's this new sexuality ed curriculum they're trying to push through and i really think it's crossing a line. i want to argue that parents should have the final say in what their kids are taught about sensitive topics like this, rather than the school just deciding for them. can you help me draft something that sounds professional but really makes the point that parental rights should come first?",
